<title>FINLAND: Partek clarifies Sisu synergy gain.</title>
<headline>Partek clarifies Sisu synergy gain.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish cargo equipment handling and construction material group Partek Oy on Wednesday clarified an earlier statement by its CEO on the synergy potential of its planned merger with state-owned heavy vehicle maker Sisu Oy.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said a figure of &quot;below 100 million markka&quot; in synergy gains on the deal which CEO Christoffer Taxell to a news conference was an annual synergy benefit -- at the news conference, Taxell did not specify a time frame.</p>
<p>&quot;They are annual synergy benefits,&quot; the spokewsoman told Reuters by telephone.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0247</p>
